# Copy to agent-secret-dirs.local. Never commit the copy.
#
# One path per line: the credential or config directory of each model provider
# the unattended agents use, plus anything else on this machine that must stay
# unreadable to the agent account. `~` is expanded. Kept outside the tracked
# tree because these paths name the tooling, and this repository does not
# publish which models read its archived material.
~/.example-provider
